        "text": "Screen for overweight and obe­ sity using BMI annually. To confirm ex­ cess adiposity, additional assessments of body fat using anthropometric as­ sessments (e.g., waist-to-hip ratio) or di­ rect measurements (e.g., dual-energy X-ray absorptiometry, bioelectrical im­ pedance analysis) could be considered where available/feasible."
