        "text": "Among people with type 2 diabetes who have established ASCVD or chronic kidney disease (CKD), a sodium–glucose cotransporter 2 (SGLT2) inhibitor or glucagon-like peptide 1 re­ ceptor agonist (GLP-1 RA) with demon­ strated cardiovascular disease benefit is recommended as part of the com­ prehensive cardiovascular risk reduc­ tion and/or glucose-lowering treatment plans."
