        "text": "In people with type 2 diabe­ tes and established ASCVD or multi­ ple risk factors for ASCVD, combined therapy with an SGLT2 inhibitor with demonstrated cardiovascular benefit and a GLP-1 RA with demonstrated cardiovascular benefit may be con­ sidered for additive reduction of the risk of adverse cardiovascular and kidney events."
